<title>USA: NYSE closing averages.</title>
<headline>NYSE closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the New York Stock Exchange closed higher in active trading Wednesday.</p>
<p>The Dow Jones Industrial Average rose 93.13 to 6945.85.</p>
<p>The NYSE Composite rose 4.99 to 420.67.</p>
<p>The average price per share rose $0.52.</p>
<p>Winners beat losers 1593 to 911.</p>
<p>Volume was 528,901,140 compared 536,219,500 on Tuesday.</p>
